<title>UK: London silver fixes sharply higher at 495.75 cents.</title>
<headline>London silver fixes sharply higher at 495.75 cents.</headline>
<text>
<p>SILVER - Fixes stronger at 495.75 cents vs 487.75 previously, up after Thursday's rally in New York.</p>
<p>GOLD - Off lows but still $0.90 lower at $346.00/$346.50 after fresh 3-1/4 low fix.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Also off day's lows after lowest fixing in 3-3/4 years. Down 25 cents at $351.00/$352.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Little changed at $121.50/$122.50.</p>
</text>
